  "credits": "Tchimera Drum Kit by Michael Willis, using samples recorded by Vincent \"Tchackpoum\" Sermone (tchackpoum.com, ReaperDrummer) in Reaper through an RME Fireface 802 and Audient preamps. Music made with it: CC0. Derivative kits (this conversion included): CC BY-SA 4.0, crediting Vincent Sermone.",
